<svg class="fig" viewBox="0 0 720 372" role="img" aria-labelledby="af-title af-desc" xmlns:c2pa="http://c2pa.org/manifest"><metadata><c2pa:manifest></c2pa:manifest></metadata>
  <title id="af-title">Actuator families grouped by energy source</title>
  <desc id="af-desc">Three families. Electromagnetic: brushed DC, brushless DC and PMSM, stepper, voice coil and linear motors. Fluid power: hydraulic cylinders and rotary actuators, servo-hydraulics, pneumatic cylinders, pneumatic muscles. Active materials: piezoelectric, shape-memory alloy, dielectric elastomer, electrohydraulic HASEL, twisted and coiled polymer.</desc>
